## Declaration — fill before any visual or copy change

```
SURFACE          [Conversion | Orientation | Execution | Receipt | Settings]
ATHLETE JOB      What must the athlete understand or do here?
CEREMONY TIER    [Operational | Ritual | Ceremonial]
DOMINANT ACTION  The one primary action — or none.
TRUTH SOURCES    Where does every displayed fact come from?
REFERENCE PATTERN Which existing FORGE component / approved surface governs?
TOKENS           Which canonical tokens / components are used?
THEMES           How do dark and light behave — each native?
GOLD             What real state or structure does it mark? (or none)
RISKS            Trust · accessibility · persistence · offline · edge states
```

Any blank row, or a token not in the canonical layer → **pixels wait.** `Reference standard: Ritz/Porsche/Yacht/Watch` is a taste prompt only—it never substitutes for ATHLETE JOB or the existing component contract.

