## Taste filter (any *no* → refine)

1. Prepared room or feature collection? 2. Serious buyer respected? 3. Good on the 100th open? 4. Gold earned? 5. Copy necessary **and provable**? 6. Anything cheap, loud, or needy? 7. Both themes native and correct?

---

## After implementing

```
- Surface / athlete job / dominant action: [named]
- Northstar tokens: [only vars — no invented literals in component code]
- Type: [operational numbers mono · serif ceremony-only · Jost aloud-test]
- Geometry: [square · touch ≥44/64]
- Gold/motion: [marks real state · ≤220ms · no fake premium]
- Themes: [dark + light both native · no filtered assets]
- Apple (if touched): [official control · no custom mark]
- Account (if touched): [server-confirmed-or-silent · no premium framing · no DB claims]
- Drift: [none / flagged: canon vs live]
- Taste filter: [pass / what to refine]
```

Pair with `.cursor/rules/form-speedandform-context.mdc` (repo context + denylist). This gate governs the **web** expression of the canon; native FORGE follows the companion gate in `FORM-iOS/.cursor/rules/`.
